## Stage 4 — Four Java Implementations: Fixed and Variable Windows

- Problem 1: Maximum Sum Subarray of Size K (Fixed Window) Problem 2: Longest Substring Without Repeating Characters (Variable Window) Problem 3: Smallest Subarray with Sum ≥ S (Variable Window) Shrink direction matters h…
- For longest windows you shrink when the window is invalid .
- For shortest windows you shrink when the window is valid , recording the length before shrinking.
