```java
// Kafka Streams: count events in a rolling 5-minute window, sliding every 1 minute
KStream<String, Event> events = builder.stream("input-topic");

events
    .groupByKey()
    .windowedBy(
        SlidingWindows.ofTimeDifferenceWithNoGrace(Duration.ofMinutes(5))
    )
    .count()
    .toStream()
    .to("output-topic");
```

